+### Deploy on Wasmer
+
+[![Deploy to Wasmer](https://img.shields.io/badge/Deploy%20to-Wasmer-171717?logo=wasmer&logoColor=white)](https://wasmer.io/apps/create?github=StartBootstrap%2Fstartbootstrap-freelancer)
+
+Wasmer serves the prebuilt `dist` directory as a static site: the `Staticfile` in the repository root points it at `dist`, and no build step runs. The button deploys this repository as-is and does not fork it; to customize the theme, fork it (or use your own copy), update `dist` by editing it directly or running `npm run build`, then import your own repository on Wasmer.
+
 ### Contact Form
 
